  "body": "Designed with family living in mind, this warm and welcoming home is a great fit for those wanting a comfortable and peaceful space. The sunny north-facing aspect is a real highlight, with a spacious private balcony providing the perfect spot for family meals or entertaining. This home has been thoughtfully updated throughout for modern living, including the kitchen and bathroom.  Light-filled open plan living flows from the enclosed private balcony right through to the second deck and kitchen. The second outdoor living area overlooking Mount Taylor Reserve adds another dimension, with an enhanced sense of space and a peaceful connection with the park directly over the fence. The bifold kitchen window allows for a stunning park view from the kitchen and to converse with guests at the outdoor table.\r\n\r\nRenovated in 2016, the home is finished with a combination of Nu-Wall and cedar cladding, giving it a smart contemporary appearance and is a low maintenance  long-term exterior.  Additionally, the home has an internal access garage, ducted heating and cooling systems and rain water tanks, complimented with a landscaped garden. It is fully fenced with access via the secure electric car and pedestrian gates.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned and in zone for Glendowie School and Glendowie College, and with Sacred Heart College also within walking distance. Local shops, parks, sports clubs and the Tamaki Estuary are just a few minutes away in this family focused neighbourhood. St Heliers village and beach are just a short drive away for shopping, dining and enjoying the waterfront and beach.\r\nCombining secure outdoor spaces, low maintenance, easy living and access to excellent local schooling, this is a well-rounded Glendowie home for families looking for comfort and convenience and foothold in this area.\r\nTo be sold by Auction 10am, Wed 18 Nov 2026 at 303 Remuera Road, Remuera",
